<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:53:15 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>伊丽莎白·霍尔姆斯的纪录片《你可以看到一切》创下有史以来第二大纪录片首映票房，几乎是汤姆·克鲁斯的《挖掘者》的两倍</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/you-can-see-everything-box-office-opening-elizabeth-holmes-documentary/</link><description>内森·菲尔德 (Nathan Fielder) 和兰斯·奥本海姆 (Lance Oppenheim) 执导的 A24 电影仅在 855 家影院就获得了 1,500 万美元的票房收入，在首映纪录片中仅次于《华氏 9/11》。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-1248465508.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:54:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/you-can-see-everything-box-office-opening-elizabeth-holmes-documentary/</guid></item><item><title>法国人发生骚乱，通货膨胀率达到 3.4%，而工资增长和 GDP 却停滞不前。特朗普治下的美国更高</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/french-riots-inflation-wage-growth-gdp-unemployment-us-prices-economic-boom/</link><description>法国失业率高达8%，其中青年失业率高达20%。各地情况并不完全相同。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2300430661-e1792421263640.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:53:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/french-riots-inflation-wage-growth-gdp-unemployment-us-prices-economic-boom/</guid></item><item><title>官方数据显示，中国正在抛售更多美国国债。但它实际上可能是一个秘密买家，大量藏品可疑地堆积在加拿大</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/china-dedollarization-us-treasury-debt-holdings-stealth-canada-belgium-custodians/</link><description>加拿大持有的美国国债从五年前的 1,690 亿美元飙升至 8 月份的 4,650 亿美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2285581687-e1792339890779.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 17:58:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/china-dedollarization-us-treasury-debt-holdings-stealth-canada-belgium-custodians/</guid></item><item><title>市场：随着债券收益率降温，股票买家介入天使不敢涉足的领域</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/buyers-step-in-where-angels-fear-to-tread/</link><description>债券市场收益率的上升使得科技公司为人工智能开发融资所需的借贷成本变得更加昂贵。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2297721738-e1792405473793.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 10:26:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/buyers-step-in-where-angels-fear-to-tread/</guid></item><item><title>穆迪首席经济学家表示，美国国债正接近债券交易员认为“恶性循环”的“风险不断增加”的程度</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/moodys-top-economist-debt-yields-borrowing-concern/</link><description>“恶性循环可能会形成，利率上升会增加利息支付和债务负担，进而进一步推高利率。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2292882779.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 14:13:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/moodys-top-economist-debt-yields-borrowing-concern/</guid></item><item><title>Tinder 的新任首席执行官向员工询问了一个关于成功的简单问题。他们的回答暴露了一个更大的问题</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/tinders-new-ceo-asked-employees-a-simple-question-about-success-their-answers-exposed-a-bigger-problem/</link><description>Tinder 的新任首席执行官正在彻底改革员工衡量成功的方式，并利用人工智能来改善约会体验。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2233024572.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:30:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/tinders-new-ceo-asked-employees-a-simple-question-about-success-their-answers-exposed-a-bigger-problem/</guid></item><item><title>Zoom 和大型金融公司添加了 Sam Altman 世界中的“人类证明”徽章，以阻止欺诈和深度造假</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/zoom-adds-proof-of-human-feature-to-stop-deep-fakes-toowith-tech/</link><description>新的安全措施将由贝恩资本和 VanEck 等公司部署，依赖于 World 的虹膜扫描球体设备。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Zoom-proof-of-human-e1792282112792.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 01:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/18/zoom-adds-proof-of-human-feature-to-stop-deep-fakes-toowith-tech/</guid></item><item><title>“他们可能认为自己可以逃避审查”：新加坡打击印尼公司跨境传播“完全可以预防”的烟雾</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/singapore-indonesian-companies-smog-border/</link><description>这使得新加坡根据《跨界烟霾污染法案》针对的印尼公司数量达到 10 家。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26282576385450-e1792421923512.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 15:11:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/singapore-indonesian-companies-smog-border/</guid></item><item><title>苏珊·戴尔 (Susan Dell) 是戴尔家族 100 亿美元捐赠业务的负责人，她最大的赌注是儿童、医疗保健和 UT Austin</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/17/susan-dell-philanthropy-10-billion-giving-operation-kids-health-care-ut-austin/</link><description>迈克尔·戴尔可能是世界上最富有的人之一，但他的妻子苏珊正在帮助决定他们数十亿财富的去向。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2299083845.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 10:48:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/17/susan-dell-philanthropy-10-billion-giving-operation-kids-health-care-ut-austin/</guid></item><item><title>Atlassian 的 Mike Cannon-Brookes：人工智能代理需要一个姓名标签，并且需要一个人对其行为负责</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/atlassian-amp-ai-agents-accountability/</link><description>坎农-布鲁克斯表示，让代理工作最困难的部分不是模型，而是界面和责任。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Mike_26-05-05_AtlassianEO_129.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/atlassian-amp-ai-agents-accountability/</guid></item></channel></rss>